GoogleTranslate_IPFinder (inspiration only)
-------------------------------------------
Project: GoodCoder666/GoogleTranslate_IPFinder
Author: GoodCoder666
URL: https://github.com/GoodCoder666/GoogleTranslate_IPFinder
License: GPL-3.0-or-later

This product was inspired by that project's approach to finding and speed-testing
Google Translate API server IPs. Specifically inspired (idea / convention level):

  - HTTPS availability probe via `/translate_a/element.js` with SNI/Host
  - Concurrent pool speed-testing to pick a low-latency IP
  - Use of public IP candidate lists (including GoodCoder666/gtdb URLs)

This repository does NOT include, copy, or vendor GoogleTranslate_IPFinder source
code. Probe concurrency, HTTPS template, SNI/Host usage, timeouts/repeats, and
IP-list fetching were reimplemented in original Go under Apache-2.0.

Original to this product (not from IPFinder):

  - Wails v2 desktop GUI and settings UI
  - Conditional system hosts updater (refresh only when current mapping fails)
  - System tray, schedules, elevation / pkexec flows
  - Cross-platform packaging (portable zip / DMG / AppImage)
  - Proxy-extension bypass helpers and related product behavior

IP candidate data
-----------------
Bundled seed IPs are a small snapshot derived from public lists associated with:
  - GoodCoder666/gtdb — https://github.com/GoodCoder666/gtdb
  - Optional online sync may also use Ponderfly/GoogleTranslateIpCheck lists

Scan range credits noted by IPFinder: gscan_quic (antigng) IP ranges.

